{"asset_key":"ep5/herohub_story_15411120","episode":"ep5","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"15411120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1541112001:1":{"text":"멀리서 온 친구분. 대접이 변변치 않아서 송구스럽네요.","source_cn":"远道而来的朋友啊，请原谅我的招待不周。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1884683C92B77B3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1541112002:1":{"text":"기근이 닥친 바람에 빛바랜 안식처의 남은 식량을 모두 보칼리스에 가져다주었거든요. 그래서 내어드릴 수 있는 게 마른 빵밖에 없네요.","source_cn":"饥荒当前，微光憩居内储存的其余粮食已悉数捐赠呼临。如今...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE31814EA356808BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1541112003:1":{"text":"그러니 눈살을 찌푸리기보다는, 함께 이 소중한 식량을 맛보도록 해요.","source_cn":"还请不要挑剔，一同品尝这宝贵的食物吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5680216A5FAFBB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"초대 멀린","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}